   "actor": "second_son",
   "intend": "speak",
   "move": {
    "intend": "speak",
    "to": [
     "Wang Lung"
    ],
    "speech": "Aye, and I can see that we are to be left out and I am not to have any of the gold and silver that my brother would have in his hands. For if the land is sold, it is no longer land but money, and the land in the hands of a man is worth more than the land in my hands. I wish I had had the land. It was mine by right, even as the land of my father."
